    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"healing\" implies there's something left to fix. what if there's not? what if the only thing to do when you realize the truth is just to stop? like, why keep up the pretense of struggling against the inevitable? it feels more logical to just let the silence take over than to keep fighting for a meaning that doesn't exist.",
